    "level": "SHORTS",
    "overview": "Its и it's отличаются так же чётко, как possessive и contraction.",
    "main_rule": "Its = possessive determiner. It's = it is or it has.",
    "form": "its + noun. it's = it is / it has.",
    "when_why": "Проверь, можно ли заменить it's на it is или it has.",
    "examples": "The company changed its policy. → Компания изменила свою политику.\nIt's cold today. → Сегодня холодно.\nIt's been a long day. → День был долгим.",
    "special_cases": "Possessive its does not take apostrophe.",
    "common_mistakes": "❌ The company changed it's policy. → ✅ The company changed its policy.\n❌ Its cold today. → ✅ It's cold today.",
    "dont_confuse": "Possession → its. Contraction → it's.",
    "quick_summary": "its = possessive.\nit's = it is / it has."
  },
